<title>BOLIVIA: Bolivian government delays YPFB privatization.</title>
<headline>Bolivian government delays YPFB privatization.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bolivian government announced on Wednesday that the postponement of the privatization of oil company Yacimientos Petroliferos Fiscales Bolivianos (YPFB) until October 31.</p>
<p>YPFB, the country's largest state-owned company, was slated to be sold on September 26.</p>
